                                                "sense_id": "ba437269-0021-3041-bb13-f979b655e077",
                                                "text": "She's purtier'n uh pitcher, son, but what in th' name o' thunderin' snakes c'n you do with 'er in this here country?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62e84d86-822a-4961-8ce9-12909cac1de6",
